*  m1_inline_ALT.sno -- FINDING-2026-08-17-s139 sec.2 table, row 4 (inline_ALT).
*
*  Same ALT as m1_defer_ALT.sno (SPAN(' ') | LEN(0)) but written INLINE in
*  Command instead of behind a separate defer *Sp.  STANDING GREEN COUNTER-
*  WITNESS: isolates "ALT reached through a defer boundary" from "ALT" itself
*  -- if this ever FAILs where m1_defer_ALT does not, the defect moved to
*  plain ALT-in-ARBNO, not the defer mechanism.
*  Oracle (SPITBOL x64 sbl -b): ok.  scrip HEAD @ s139: ok (already passes).
         &ANCHOR      =  1
         Word         =  SPAN('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
         Command      =  Word (SPAN(' ') | LEN(0))
         L            =  ARBNO(*Command)
         Src          =  'START HERE'
         Src          POS(0) L RPOS(0)                            :F(FA)
         OUTPUT       =  'ok'                                     :(END)
FA       OUTPUT       =  'FAIL'
END
